WEBVTT

00:04:59.163 --> 00:05:02.663
and if you listen, it plays
"Twinkle, Twinkle Little Star."

00:05:04.788 --> 00:05:06.829
So, all of this together,

00:05:06.871 --> 00:05:08.996
the last thing is interaction.

00:05:09.038 --> 00:05:12.204
So, you have a robot,
you want it to be your playmate,

00:05:12.246 --> 00:05:14.621
your teacher, your instructor,

00:05:14.663 --> 00:05:16.663
you want it to interact.

00:05:17.246 --> 00:05:18.871
And isn't it so cute?

00:05:20.538 --> 00:05:22.288
So, interaction is key,

00:05:22.329 --> 00:05:26.038
it is key to understanding
how to work in our world with us,

00:05:26.079 --> 00:05:28.371
and so the interaction piece
is very important.